strating relevant price/time constraint; ASR uncertainty checked first"}, {"to": "CLOSE", "condition": "Semantic goal achieved with independently formulated response; any suitable wording accepted"}, {"to": "REPAIR", "condition": "Unclear response, explicit clarification or transcript uncertainty"}], "assistant_el": "Ωραία. Θέλετε να ακυρώσουμε την παλιά θέση και να κρατήσουμε τη νέα;", "learner_goal_ru": "Подтвердить обе части изменения.", "acceptable_examples_el": ["Ναι, ακυρώστε την Τρίτη και κρατήστε τη θέση την Τετάρτη στις επτά και μισή."]}, {"node_id": "CLOSE", "transitions": [{"to": "DONE", "condition": "Confirmed learner response fulfils final goal and all branch-specific critical facts; evaluate quoted evidence before marking task success"}, {"to": "REPAIR", "condition": "Final answer unclear, learner asks clarification or ASR uncertain; save return_node=CLOSE"}], "assistant_el": "Έγινε. Σας περιμένουμε την Τετάρτη στις επτά και μισή.", "learner_goal_ru": "Повторить итог адресату без добавления условий.", "acceptable_examples_el": ["Ευχαριστώ. Θα έρθω την Τετάρτη στις επτά και μισή."], "awaits_learner_response": true}, {"node_id": "REPAIR", "transitions": [{"to": "OPEN", "guard": {"return_node": "OPEN", "repair_count_lt": 2}, "condition": "Clarification supplied; repair_count<2 and saved return_node==OPEN; repeat only necessary task fact without supplying learner answer"}, {"to": "TWIST", "guard": {"return_node": "TWIST", "repair_count_lt": 2}, "condition": "Clarification supplied; repair_count<2 and saved return_node==TWIST; repeat only necessary task fact without supplying learner answer"}, {"to": "NEGOTIATE", "guard": {"return_node": "NEGOTIATE", "repair_count_lt": 2}, "condition": "Clarification supplied; repair_count<2 and saved return_node==NEGOTIATE; repeat only necessary task fact without supplying learner answer"}, {"to": "CLOSE", "guard": {"return_node": "CLOSE", "repair_count_lt": 2}, "condition": "Clarification supplied; repair_count<2 and save